      "blocks": {
        "item_cw39dL": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/TM030_Treadmill_For_Home_Workout2_800x600_84c626a7-0a39-4660-bee1-a5118fd3597d.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "5-Layer Joint-friendly Running Belt",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Shock-absorbing, durable, and anti-static. <strong>Five layers</strong> of careful design will help you regain your motility and engage in mild exercise. With a comfy foot, you'll feel as if you're walking on a plastic track, and your knees will never squeak.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_cWxHQa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/TM030_Treadmill_With_Incline_750x500_bcdae5a4-40bf-437e-991c-0832ff3f7944.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Effective Workout With 10% Incline",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Achieve an effective workout with a 10% manual incline, adjustable across 4 levels (0%, 3%, 6%, and 10%). Combined with a <strong>1-5mph speed range</strong>, this treadmill adapts to walking, jogging, or running, catering to diverse fitness routines.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_HqNJrX": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/TM030_Treadmill_for_home_workout_800x600_bc4320f2-86fb-4f29-9c5f-65ae7b8e2ee2.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Quiet Quality Brushless Motor",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>No need to worry about a loud motor in meetings; Or when your roomie demands space and quiet. Or being complained when exercising at night. You can also enable the <strong>MUTE mode</strong> via remote control.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
